'''Morad Sumar's farm''' was a [[farm]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[Planet|world]] of [[Lothal]] belonging to the [[farmer]] [[Morad Sumar]].<ref name="Fighter Flight" /> In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> the farm was [[Attack on Imperial Troop Transports|destroyed]] by [[Supply Master]] [[Yogar Lyste]], when Sumar refused to sell the land to the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Fighter Flight" />

